# Flyway migrations directory
#
# To create the initial migration:
# 1. Start a temporary PostgreSQL database
# 2. Set hibernate.ddl-auto=create in application.yml
# 3. Start the application to let Hibernate create the schema
# 4. Export the schema: pg_dump --schema-only > V1__Initial_schema.sql
# 5. Restore hibernate.ddl-auto=validate
#
# Or follow instructions in DATABASE_MIGRATIONS.md
